3.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-19T17:12:21Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14741\r\n\r\nAdds Mesh equivalents of MultiMesh's `multimesh_get_buffer_rd_rid` so GPU-driven mesh workflows in a GDExtension can write directly into a surface's vertex, attribute, skin, or index buffer from a compute pipeline, avoiding the CPU round-trip through `mesh_surface_update_*_region`.\r\n\r\nA new `ARRAY_FLAG_USE_STORAGE_BUFFER` surface format flag opts the backing buffers into storage-buffer usage so they can be bound in compute shaders.\r\n\r\nThis change is for Vulkan/D3D12/Metal only, OpenGL returns an invalid RID (same as the MultiMesh implementation).\r\n\r\nSee [the proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14741) for more info about why this is needed.\r\n\r\n_Bugsquad edit: Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14329_\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used in the planning and review of this change, as well as some minor edits. Any code not physically typed out by myself has been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability._\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht